{"version":1,"content":"<p>警方今年年初起發現青少年罪案有上升趨勢，有組織罪案及三合會調查科（O記）遂派臥底滲透三合會社團蒐證，並於本周四（29日）突擊搜查港島、九龍及新界多個地點，共拘捕58人，包括49男9女，年齡介乎14至73歲；</p><p>其中21人有三合會背景，13人為未成年人士，10人為學生。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:12.809156+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T05:18:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:24.871918+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.050727+00:00","content_hash":"eccc91bfb6d77b1f3adf1faaf753ea8515e8ca1d56f840a5d17572bbf11175bd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}